  "item": [
    {
      "id": "e1874991-2fd2-490a-a712-fbf60dface7d",
      "name": "Dataset Definitions",
      "description": {
        "content": "Dataset definitions describe the fields with special meaning in the Dataset.\n\nRefer to the [Dataset Definitions](https://docs.honeycomb.io/configure/datasets/definitions/) documentation for more information.\n\n**Honeycomb automatically creates these Dataset definition fields when the Dataset is created.**\nManual creation of Dataset definitions is **not** needed.\n\n## Authorization\n\nThe API key must have the **Create Datasets** permission. Learn more about [API keys here](https://docs.honeycomb.io/configure/environments/manage-api-keys/).\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
